Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:56:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Desk screens: tension and timer on the strip, sticky
 stamps, withdrawn request note, header spacing, wording

45.1 TableStrip carries tension -/+ and timer start or pause on the Lightkeeper's desk. 45.4/45.5 the dispatch stamps stay at the foot of the xl column and End Assignment's line grows upward. 45.6 empty requests name the campaign code, invite wording. 45.7 a withdrawn request keeps its sheet open with a note. 60.6 drives rule in End Assignment's info and an i beside Reset. 60.19 every waiting name has its count. 69.4 one-sentence Finalize confirm. 69.8b header below xl stacks. Built with vite; browser checks follow.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WaLz6UBTQ5XaTKSYwqeMKA
